          "id": "post_guard",
          "displayName": "Post Guard",
          "_comment": "Combat-hold check: a hostile that never leaves its annex post (chaseSpeed 1, a crawl) while the player works in the lobby. It is chasing but in another room, so it must not hold a call.",
          "npcType": "person",
          "position": {
            "x": 1.5,
